# Reference — the SAME CASSCF from ORCA's DEFAULT guess (no fragment merge).
# For this simple, near-degenerate bare ion the default guess converges cleanly,
# so compare the merge against this before trusting it.
! CASSCF def2-SVP
%casscf
   nel  5
   norb 5
   mult 6
   maxiter 200
end
* xyz 2 6
  Mn  0.0  0.0  0.0
  O   2.10  0.0  0.0
  H   2.65  0.76 0.0
  H   2.65 -0.76 0.0
*
# Result (cas-default.out): CONVERGED, FINAL SPE = -1225.020664994659 Eh,
#   N(occ) = 1.00000 x 5  -> a clean high-spin d5 active space.
